@startuml
actor Operator
participant "Backup Script" as Backup
database PostgreSQL
cloud MinIO
component Qdrant
participant "Checksum Manifest" as Manifest
participant "Restore Script" as Restore
Operator -> Backup: execute governed backup
Backup -> PostgreSQL: pg_dump custom format
Backup -> MinIO: optional versioned object archive
Backup -> Qdrant: optional vector storage archive
Backup -> Manifest: file sizes + SHA-256
Backup --> Operator: timestamped backup directory
Operator -> Restore: explicit destructive confirmation
Restore -> Manifest: verify all checksums
Restore -> PostgreSQL: pg_restore
Restore -> MinIO: optional restore
Restore -> Qdrant: optional restore
Restore --> Operator: run migrations, isolation, readiness, role smoke tests
@enduml
